# Example

Suppose we have the following data:

```text
10

20

30

40

50
```

Then `describe()` will return:

| Statistic    |          Value |
| ------------ | -------------: |
| count        |              5 |
| mean         |             30 |
| std          | Spread of data |
| min          |             10 |
| 25%          |             20 |
| 50% (Median) |             30 |
| 75%          |             40 |
| max          |             50 |

