# Why Does `df.describe()` Work Only on Numerical Columns?

Example:

```text
Utkarsh

Rahul

Aman
```

Can we calculate the average of names?

No.

Therefore, by default, `df.describe()` works only on numerical columns.

To summarize text (categorical) columns:

```python
df.describe(include="object")
```

This returns:

* count
* unique
* top (most frequent value)
* freq (frequency of the most frequent value)

